ilitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/auto-snap-band-making-machine-detail1_syy-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/auto-snap-band-making-machine-detail1_syy-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/auto-snap-band-making-machine-detail1_syy-600x600.png 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/auto-snap-band-making-machine-detail1_syy-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8b55ca0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8b55ca0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>The Advantage of Our Automatic Snap Band Cutting Machine<\/h2><p>This machine is a perfect choice for reducing labor and realizing factory automation, which can reduce labor demand in large quantities<\/p><ol><li>High speed<\/li><li>High stability<\/li><li>Touch screen operation, simple and convenient<\/li><\/ol><p>\u00a0<\/p><h2>Specification<\/h2><ol><li>Power Supply: 220V, 50\/60Hz or custom<\/li><li>Power Consumption: 3KVA<\/li><li>Diameter of Snap Rings: standard 100-200mm, 90-300mm can be customized<\/li><li>Width of Snap Band: 19-40mm(e.g. 19, 20, 25, 30, 35, 40mm, etc.)<\/li><li>Rivet Holes Center to Center Distance: 11, 16, 20, 24mm, etc.<\/li><li>Rivet Diameter: 2.9mm capped rivet, hollow or half hollow<\/li><li>Machine Speed: 8 sec per piece (based on rings of 130mm diameter)<\/li><li>Diameter Tolerance: +\/-0.2mm<\/li><li>Maximum Cutting Force: 13 Ton<\/li><li>Maximum Riveting Force: 3 Ton<\/li><li>Compressed Air Pressure Required: 0.6-0.8MPa<\/li><li>Compressed Air Consumption: 300L\/min<\/li><li>Machine Body Size: 170x120x185cm<\/li><li>Material Stand Size:60x60x80cm<\/li><li>Machine Weight:about 1000kgs<\/li><\/ol><h2>Consumable PartsList<\/h2><p>\u00a0<\/p><table><tbody><tr><td width=\"90\">1<\/td><td width=\"359\">Cutter Piece<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"90\">2<\/td><td width=\"359\">Cutter Pins<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"90\">3<\/td><td width=\"359\">Riveting Pins<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"90\">4<\/td><td width=\"359\">Rivet Grippers<\/td><\/tr><tr><td width=\"90\">5<\/td><td width=\"359\">Band Pulling Hooks<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><h2>\u00a0<\/h2><h2>Motors<\/h2><p>There are total 7 step motors and 1 servo motor on this machine, it\u2019s critical to know the name, the number and the function of each motor.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5cb59ae elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"5cb59ae\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Figure-17.-Motors-auto-snap-band-making-machine-detail2_syy.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3508\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Figure-17.-Motors-auto-snap-band-making-machine-detail2_syy.png 1000w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Figure-17.-Motors-auto-snap-band-making-machine-detail2_syy-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Figure-17.-Motors-auto-snap-band-making-machine-detail2_syy-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Figure-17.-Motors-auto-snap-band-making-machine-detail2_syy-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Figure-17.-Motors-auto-snap-band-making-machine-detail2_syy-600x600.png 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Figure-17.-Motors-auto-snap-band-making-machine-detail2_syy-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-34705eb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"34705eb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Lubrication<\/h2><p>To achieve a good machine condition, reduce the wear of parts, increase its life span, the machine should be lubricated correctly and sufficiently. For parts that require daily check or maintenance, it should be done every day before the shift starts or at the end of the day after shut off the machine<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><ol><li>The parts that require machine oil lubrication are all the guiding poles on the cutting unit and the riveting unit.<\/li><\/ol><p>Recommended machine oil type is HJ-30 or HJ-40, e.g. Mobil HP461.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-45195d6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"45195d6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Figure-18.-Motors-auto-snap-band-making-machine-detail3_syy.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3509\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Figure-18.-Motors-auto-snap-band-making-machine-detail3_syy.png 1000w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Figure-18.-Motors-auto-snap-band-making-machine-detail3_syy-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Figure-18.-Motors-auto-snap-band-making-machine-detail3_syy-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/11\/Figure-18.-Motors-auto-